{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-js","path":"/blog/2024-12-19-how-to-use-delay-in-react-js/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"excerpt":"Hi Friends 👋, Welcome To aHoisting! To use delay in react js, you have to use . It will use delay in react js. Today, I am going to show you, how to use delay…","html":"<p>Hi Friends 👋,</p>\n<p>Welcome To aHoisting!</p>\n<p>To use delay in react js, you have to use <code class=\"language-text\">setTimeout(resolve, ms));</code>. It will use delay in react js.</p>\n<p>Today, I am going to show you, how to use delay in react js.</p>\n<p>Table of contents</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install and create a new React app.</li>\n<li>Import react component.</li>\n<li>Create a Component.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Let’s start with the first step.</p>\n<h2>Step 1: Install and create a new React app.</h2>\n<p>First you have to install the React project. You should use <code class=\"language-text\">create-react-app</code> command to create a new React project.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\">npx create<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>react<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\ncd my<span class=\"token operator\">-</span>app\nnpm start</code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 2: Import react component.</h2>\n<p>After installing, you have to import your React component.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Step 3: Create a Component.</h2>\n<p>You can use <code class=\"language-text\">setTimeout(resolve, ms));</code> to use delay in react js.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h1<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n    aHoisting\n\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h1<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\tThis is the initial text<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button \n\t\t\tonClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>handleClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t\tShow Delayed Text\n\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>showDelayedText <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t\t\tThis text appears after a \n\t\t\t\t\tdelay using async<span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token keyword\">await</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span></code></pre></div>\n<h2>Use delay example.</h2>\n<p>The below code is an example of a React. You have to import <code class=\"language-text\">react</code> and use <code class=\"language-text\">setTimeout(resolve, ms));</code> to use delay in react js.</p>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">App.js</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre class=\"language-js\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> React<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> useState <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'react'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">App</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>showDelayedText<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> setShowDelayedText<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> \n\t\t<span class=\"token function\">useState</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">delay</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">ms</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Promise</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">resolve</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> \n\t\t\t<span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>resolve<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ms<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"token function-variable function\">handleClick</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">2000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token function\">setShowDelayedText</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>h1<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n      aHoisting\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>h1<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t\tThis is the initial text<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>button \n\t\t\t\t\tonClick<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>handleClick<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t\tShow Delayed Text\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>button<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>showDelayedText <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t\t\tThis text appears after a \n\t\t\t\t\tdelay using async<span class=\"token operator\">/</span><span class=\"token keyword\">await</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>p<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token operator\">/</span>div<span class=\"token operator\">></span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">default</span> App<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>In the above code example, I have used the <code class=\"language-text\">setTimeout(resolve, ms));</code> to use delay in react js.</p>\n<p>Check the output of the above code.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 484px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/5974f25ff42925a710c9734aca9ed7a6/bdae1/use-delay.webp\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 87.34177215189874%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/webp;base64,UklGRloAAABXRUJQVlA4IE4AAACQAwCdASoUABEAPtFepUyoJaOiMBgIAQAaCWUAzfwQ5Nfk9EqAAPff7ZR99Ff7zEU9dkBOCiebnjx6Z1+Tse+0BnmqqNjKKwvmgZbJAAA='); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"React, use, delay\"\n        title=\"React, use, delay\"\n        src=\"/static/5974f25ff42925a710c9734aca9ed7a6/bdae1/use-delay.webp\"\n        srcset=\"/static/5974f25ff42925a710c9734aca9ed7a6/81b7c/use-delay.webp 158w,\n/static/5974f25ff42925a710c9734aca9ed7a6/6ea66/use-delay.webp 315w,\n/static/5974f25ff42925a710c9734aca9ed7a6/bdae1/use-delay.webp 484w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 484px) 100vw, 484px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>All the best 👍</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"How to use delay in react js?","tags":["React"],"date":"December 19, 2024","description":"Example of use delay in react js with step by step tutorial - aHoisting","social_image":{"absolutePath":"/Users/mac/Documents/hoisting/ahoisting/static/media/template/reactjs.jpg"}}},"prev":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use datepicker in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-20-how-to-use-datepicker-in-react-js/"}},"next":{"frontmatter":{"title":"How to use confirm box in react js?"},"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-18-how-to-use-confirm-box-in-react-js/"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/blog/2024-12-19-how-to-use-delay-in-react-js/","prevSlug":"/blog/2024-12-20-how-to-use-datepicker-in-react-js/","nextSlug":"/blog/